@startuml RF12_Sequencia
title RF12 — Visualizar & Editar a página "Minhas Fotos" & Adicionar mais de uma peça por vez dentro do sistema\nDiagrama de sequência — endpoints reais
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as P
participant "Frontend\n(app)/photos · multi-piece-review" as FE
participant "PhotoController" as PC
participant "WardrobeController" as WC
participant "PhotoService" as PS
participant "WardrobeService" as WS
participant "MultiPieceService" as MP
participant "AiEngine (RF24)" as AI
participant "MediaStoragePort\n(S3 / local)" as ST
database "MySQL" as DB

== Minhas Fotos ==
P -> FE: abre /photos
FE -> PC: GET /api/me/photos?origin=&month=&page=0&size=60
PC -> PS: gallery(user, Filter, page, size)
PS -> DB: photos (deletedAt IS NULL) ORDER BY createdAt DESC
PC --> FE: 200 {items, facets, counts (por origem), hasMore, total}
loop rolagem (InfiniteSentinel — CA06)
  FE -> PC: GET /api/me/photos?page=n
end
P -> FE: exclui uma foto
FE -> PC: DELETE /api/photos/{id}
PC -> PS: delete(user, id, confirmed=false)
alt imagem de peça ativa (CA03)
  PS --> FE: 409 CONFIRMACAO_NECESSARIA {pieceId}
  P -> FE: confirma
  FE -> PC: DELETE /api/photos/{id}?confirmed=true
  PC -> PS: delete(user, id, true)
  PS -> WS: useDefaultImageAfterPhotoDeletion(peça)
end
PS -> DB: photos.deletedAt = agora
PC --> FE: 200 {deleted: 1, pieceWithoutImage}
FE -> PC: POST /api/photos/bulk-deletion {ids, confirmed: false}
PC -> PS: bulkDelete(user, ids, false)
PC --> FE: 200 {requiresConfirmation, count, linkedToPieces, message} (CA04)
FE -> PC: POST /api/photos/bulk-deletion {ids, confirmed: true}
PC --> FE: 200 {deleted}
FE -> PC: GET /api/photos/{id}/file
PC -> PS: download(user, id) (só o dono — CA05)
PS -> ST: read(originalUrl)
PC --> FE: 200 bytes originais
opt editar no Canvas 2D (CA02 — RF15)
  FE -> PC: POST /api/photos/{id}/edits (multipart)
  PC -> PS: saveEdit(user, id, bytes)
  PS -> ST: put(edição) · INSERT photos (EDITOR, metadata editedFrom)
end
FE -> PC: POST /api/me/photos/curation
PC -> PS: curate(user)
PS -> AI: local(PHOTO_CURATOR) — dHash local
PC --> FE: 200 {duplicatas, baixa qualidade, sugestão de qual manter}
== Várias peças por vez ==
alt várias fotos (uma peça por foto)
  FE -> WC: POST /api/pieces/analysis/batch (files[], category)
  WC -> WS: analyzeBatch(user, files, category)
  alt 0 ou mais de 12 fotos
    WS --> FE: 400 SEM_FOTOS | LOTE_GRANDE
  else
    loop cada foto
      WS -> WS: analyze(user, bytes, category)
      alt foto fora dos critérios
        WS -> WS: Draft.rejected(motivo)
      else aceita
        WS -> DB: INSERT pipeline_jobs (PIECE_DRAFT, COMPLETED)
        WS -> ST: put(users/{id}/drafts/{jobId}/...)
      end
    end
    WC --> FE: 200 List<Draft>
  end
else uma foto com várias peças
  FE -> WC: POST /api/pieces/analysis/multi (file)
  WC -> MP: detect(user, bytes)
  MP -> AI: text(MULTI_PIECE_DETECTOR, foto reduzida)
  MP -> DB: INSERT pipeline_jobs (MULTI_PIECE_DRAFT, COMPLETED)
  WC --> FE: 200 Detection {draftId, pieces[box, name, category...], source}
  loop cada peça revisada (MultiPieceReview)
    FE -> WC: POST /api/pieces/analysis/multi/{draftId}/pieces?index=i (recorte)
    WC -> MP: pieceDraft(user, draftId, index, bytes)
    MP -> AI: execute(FLAT_LAY_STANDARDIZER) · text(CONTENT_MODERATOR)
    WC --> FE: 200 PieceDraft | 400 CONTEUDO_BLOQUEADO
  end
end
P -> FE: confirma o lote revisado
FE -> WC: POST /api/pieces/batch [PieceForm...]  (ou POST /api/pieces por item)
WC -> WS: createBatch(user, forms) → create(user, form) para cada
WS -> DB: INSERT wardrobe_items · INSERT photos (WARDROBE_ITEM)
WC --> FE: 201 List<PieceView>
@enduml
